/**
 * THE VIEW THROUGH THE YEAR: sixteen painted scenes, four per season.

 * One oak, farmhouse and dry-stone wall, painted as tall panels in the style of
 * the earlier round weather paintings and delivered one sheet per season. Rows:
 * spring (clear, cloudy, rain, mist), summer (clear, big clouds, heat haze,
 * thunderstorm), autumn (clear, windy with leaves, rain, fog), winter (clear
 * frost, overcast, snowfall, blizzard). The window shows a panel as painted; the
 * weather glass takes a circle from it, centred on the tree. Pick with
 * `weatherScene` (BrassHud).
 */
